quirements for all=20
non-U.S. citizens entering and exiting the country, covering land borders, =
airports, and seaports.=20
The new rule, effective December 26, also allows for the collection of addi=
tional biometric data=20
such as fingerprints and removes age exemptions for travelers under 14 and =
over 79.

